{"path":"thread/cnd_signal","title":"cnd_signal","titleHtml":"cnd_signal","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/thread/cnd_signal","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Unblocks one thread that currently waits on condition variable pointed to by cond. If no threads are blocked, does nothing and returns thrd_success.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/thread\"><code>&lt;threads.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> cnd_signal<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/c/thread\"><span class=\"kw1025\">cnd_t</span></a> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>cond <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(since C11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Unblocks one thread that currently waits on condition variable pointed to by <code>cond</code>. If no threads are blocked, does nothing and returns <code>thrd_success</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  cond\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  pointer to a condition variable\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/thread/thrd_errors\">thrd_success</a></span> if successful, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/thread/thrd_errors\">thrd_error</a></span> otherwise.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.26.3.4 The cnd_signal function (p: 276)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.26.3.4 The cnd_signal function (p: 379)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/thread/cnd_broadcast\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>cnd_broadcast</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(C11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   unblocks all threads blocked on a condition variable  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/condition_variable/notify_one\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>condition_variable::notify_one</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/condition_variable_any/notify_one\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>condition_variable_any::notify_one</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"cnd_signal","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Unblocks one thread that currently waits on condition variable pointed to by cond."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"cond"},{"label":"Return value","note":"thrd_success if successful, thrd_error otherwise."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"cnd_broadcast","note":"unblocks all threads blocked on a condition variable"}]}]},"standards":["C11"],"wordCount":90,"codeBlockCount":0}
